   149	
   150	**Outside this solver's identity:** the xpbd solver (reference/referee, not modified); the two-field bed-coupling operator's kind (cell-centered pore pressure = projection pressure preserved); no divergence-penalty Darcy; no compliance diagonal (already rejected); no global Poisson in this plan.
